\ulnone\cf2 , and talent development. Janus Henderson will continue to operate under the leadership of Chief Executive Officer Ali Dibadj, maintaining operational bases in both London and Denver. Dibadj commented on the development, stating the firm remains dedicated to delivering exceptional services and insights to clients while pursuing transformative opportunities in partnership with Trian and General Catalyst. Trian's CEO Nelson Peltz noted the impressive progress Janus Henderson has made since Trian's initial investment in 2020. General Catalyst's CEO Hemant Taneja stated the firm's commitment to enhancing Janus Henderson's technological capabilities and overall growth strategy, with the strategic partnership expected to unlock new standards within the asset management industry. The transaction drew support from a broad investor group that included MassMutual and Sun Hung Kai & Co.}
{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 Separately, on June 17, 2026, Gurugram-based startup Omli announced the successful close of a $1.5 million seed funding round led by India Quotient, with participation from General Catalyst. Founded in 2025 by Shivam Munshi and Siddhant Garg, Omli is developing AI infrastructure tailored specifically for children's speech and language development \u8212  a segment largely underserved by existing commercial speech recognition systems, which are predominantly trained on adult voices. The company's flagship application, OmliKids, allows children aged three to ten to engage in voice-based conversations with an AI companion named Doro, and has already surpassed 500,000 downloads on the Google Play Store within months of launch. To address the limitations of conventional speech models, Omli has developed VedAnsh-v1, a proprietary speech-to-text and voice activity detection system designed specifically for children's voices and demonstrating meaningful improvements in word error rates compared to existing commercial alternatives. Co-founder Siddhant Garg emphasized ambitions to achieve adult-grade accuracy in children's speech recognition, including support for Indian accents and vernacular languages. Investor India Quotient's Madhukar characterized the opportunity by noting that children represent the largest consumer segment for which AI solutions are yet to be developed.}
{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 General Catalyst also led an $85 million growth round for Rylo, formerly known as Nagish, through its Customer Value Fund, with co-investment from Canaan, Vertex Ventures, and Contour. The funding pushes Rylo's total capital raised beyond $100 million. Headquartered across Tel Aviv and New York, Rylo develops AI-powered communication tools to improve accessibility for }
{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b\i\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ul\cf2 Deaf}{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0
\ulnone\cf2  and hard-of-hearing individuals, offering real-time captioning for phone calls, instant speech-to-text conversion, text-to-speech capabilities, and in-person transcription services. Following its acquisition of Sign.mt in 2025, the company launched Rylo Sign, enabling real-time translation between spoken and sign languages. The platform incorporates additional AI capabilities including speaker recognition, }
{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b\i\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ul\cf2 sentiment}{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0
\ulnone\cf2  analysis, and fraud detection. The newly raised capital is earmarked for expanding engineering, product development, and commercial operations teams, alongside investment in AI research, infrastructure development, and new workplace accessibility solutions.}
{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 Among General Catalyst's most closely watched peers, Andreessen Horowitz has sustained a robust pace of investment activity across enterprise fintech, large-scale startup funding, and healthcare }{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24
\ltrch\b\i\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ul\cf2 technology}{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 . The firm led a $20 million seed round for Pillar, a financial risk management startup founded by CEO Harsha Ramesh and CTO Chinmay Deshpande. The round, notable for its size relative to typical early-stage enterprise fintech raises, also drew participation from Uber CEO Dara Khosrowshahi, Crucible Capital, and Gallery Ventures. Pillar is targeting the complex challenge of financial risk management, which many companies continue to address through a combination of spreadsheets, legacy systems, and high-cost enterprise tools. Andreessen Horowitz's involvement reflects its broader strategy of investing in foundational software integral to business infrastructure, while Khosrowshahi's participation lends further credibility given his experience overseeing financial operations in global markets.}
{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 On July 3, 2026, Andreessen Horowitz announced it is leading a private funding round for Switch targeting approximately $2 billion, which would place Switch among an exclusive group of startups to have raised a ten-figure sum in a single effort. Specific details regarding Switch's valuation and the nature of its products have not yet been disclosed. The round follows Andreessen Horowitz's recent co-leadership of a $2 billion raise for AI coding startup Cursor, developed by Anysphere, alongside Nvidia and Thrive Capital \u8212  a deal that elevated Cursor's valuation to over $50 billion. The firm also anchored a record $2 billion seed round for Thinking Machines Lab, making the Switch round at least the third instance in which Andreessen Horowitz has led a raise in that range.}
{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 Andreessen Horowitz also led a $30 million Series A financing round for Prosper AI, a healthcare administration platform that reported a fivefold revenue increase and now manages over $1.3 billion in patient care as of June 30, 2026. Prosper AI's platform handles scheduling, insurance verification, patient billing, and payer communications, with the company reporting that healthcare providers utilizing its tools can reduce administrative costs by more than 40%. Clients include Athenahealth and Jackson Memorial Hospital. Co-Founder and Co-CEO Xavier de Gracia indicated that the new capital will support expansion of the engineering team, deeper integrations with Electronic Health Record systems, and accelerated market adoption. Jay Rughani, Partner at Andreessen Horowitz, cited the firm's admiration for Prosper AI's ambition to eliminate administrative hurdles in healthcare as a central driver of the investment decision.}
{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 Sequoia Capital partner Luciana Lixandru, the firm's first European partner, offered a forward-looking perspective on the European }{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b\i\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ul\cf2 tech}{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2  landscape during a conversation on June 23, 2026, asserting that the region is entering a pivotal phase with the potential to produce a trillion-dollar }
{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b\i\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ul\cf2 technology}{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0
\ulnone\cf2  company. Lixandru, who has worked with startups including Deliveroo, UiPath, and Vinted, described European founders as increasingly capable of building generational companies, pointing to Pennylane and ElevenLabs as examples of the shifting founder profile \u8212  entrepreneurs with backgrounds in established }
{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b\i\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ul\cf2 tech}{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0
\ulnone\cf2  firms now building innovative solutions on the continent. She identified artificial intelligence as a key equalizer enabling European entrepreneurs to compete globally, while acknowledging that fragmented regional ecosystems and limited cross-border collaboration frameworks remain persistent challenges. Sequoia Capital's ongoing investments in European ventures are positioned as a contributing factor to the region's long-term growth trajectory.}
{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 Sequoia partner Shaun Maguire, writing on June 16, 2026, argued that SpaceX's recent public offering \u8212  priced at approximately $135 per share with a post-IPO valuation surpassing $2 trillion \u8212  will accelerate a migration of talent from established research institutions and software roles into hardware-centric sectors including biology, longevity, energy, and climate }
{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b\i\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ul\cf2 technology}{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0
\ulnone\cf2 . Maguire noted that a substantial portion of the hardware startups he encounters already include SpaceX alumni among their founding teams, drawing a parallel to the entrepreneurial spillover that followed PayPal's early-2000s listing. Sequoia's own stake in SpaceX reportedly grew from approximately $2 billion to over $20 billion following the IPO, with Maguire having personally invested roughly $1.2 billion in the company since 2019 through the firm. Maguire cautioned that execution risks remain, particularly regulatory timelines in biology, capital intensity in energy, and policy sensitivity in climate }
{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b\i\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ul\cf2 technology}{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0
